{"version":1,"key":"card:399","content":{"id":399,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"PQ4R 学习技巧："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"预习（Preview）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"了解每章的主要结构和主题，浏览重要标题和图表，能够清楚的知道该章节包含的主要内容"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"问题（Question）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"阅读时进行提问，可以将标题转化为问题，比如章节标题是“心理学的目标”，可以转化为问题，“心理学的目标是什么？”"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"阅读（Read）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"仔细阅读章节内容，直到能回答你提出的问题"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"思考（Relfect）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"将章节内容与已有的知识关联起来"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"重述（Recite）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在阅读和思考完后，试着回忆章节的内容，回答自己提出的问题"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"复习（Review）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"复习关键点，如果此时还不能回忆出重点内容，重复上面阅读、思考和重述的流程，直到能回忆出重点内容以及能回答出你的问题"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《心理学与生活》，如何使用本书"}]}]}]}],"tags":["学习方法"],"createTime":1705156879169,"updateTime":1743303640428,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640428}}